# CVE-2024-21907: Newtonsoft.Json in react-native-fs/windows/RNFS.Net46
# This is a Windows-platform NuGet dependency inside node_modules.
# The app targets Android and iOS only — the Windows code path is never compiled or shipped.
CVE-2024-21907

# GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2: react-router RSC Mode CSRF Bypass (react-router 7.x, fixed in 8.3.0)
# This CVE only affects React Server Components (RSC) mode, which requires a file-based
# router (@react-router/fs-routes / Remix-style). This app is a client-side Vite SPA —
# RSC mode is not used, so the attack surface does not exist.
GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2

# CVE-2026-14257 / GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg: brace-expansion DoS (< 5.0.8)
